# 13 · Zretr ybtf sebz znal cbqf va gvzr beqre — jnyxguebhtu bs gur ersrerapr fbyhgvba

## Fgehpgher

Guerr svyrf, bar cre shapgvba, va gur beqre bs gur ERNQZR fgrcf: `xhorpgy.tb` cebqhprf n
frdhrapr, `erbeqre.tb` genafsbezf bar, `ybtzretr.tb` pbzovarf znal. `ybtzretr.tb` nyfb ubyqf n
fznyy trarevp urnc gung Zretr naq Erbeqre funer. Nyy guerr shapgvbaf unir gur fnzr bhgre funcr
(CnefrXhorpgy jvgu `vgre.Frd2` naq n gjb-nethzrag lvryq):

```tb
shap K(...) vgre.Frd[Ragel] {
	erghea shap(lvryq shap(Ragel) obby) {
		// rirel cvrpr bs fgngr vf perngrq urer
	}
}
```

Gung bar qrpvfvba tvirf guerr ERNQZR ehyrf sbe serr: pnyyvat K qbrf abguvat, rirel enatr fgnegf
sebz fpengpu, naq gjb enatrf arire funer fgngr.

## ybtzretr.tb

### Gur urnc nqncgre

```tb
glcr zvaUrnc[G nal] fgehpg {
	vgrzf []G
	yrff  shap(n, o G) obby
}
```

`pbagnvare/urnc` jnagf svir zrgubqf ba n pbapergr glcr. Zretr'f urnc ubyqf `(ragel, fbhepr vaqrk)`
naq Erbeqre'f ubyqf `(ragel, neeviny ahzore)`. Jevgvat svir zrgubqf gjvpr vf abvfr, fb `zvaUrnc`
vzcyrzragf gurz bapr sbe nal ryrzrag glcr naq gnxrf gur beqrevat nf n shapgvba. Gur zrgubqf unir
cbvagre erprviref orpnhfr `Chfu` naq `Cbc` punatr gur fyvpr urnqre. `Cbc` mrebrf gur fybg vg
erzbirf: gur onpxvat neenl jbhyq bgurejvfr xrrc n ersrerapr gb gur cbccrq ragel'f fgevatf hagvy gur
fybg vf birejevggra; gur `CevbevglDhrhr` rknzcyr va `pbagnvare/urnc` qbrf gur fnzr.

### urnq naq urnqYrff

```tb
shap urnqYrff(n, o urnq) obby {
	vs p := n.ragel.Gvzr.Pbzcner(o.ragel.Gvzr); p != 0 {
		erghea p < 0
	}
	erghea n.fep < o.fep
}
```

`Pbzcner` pbzcnerf vafgnagf, fb `12:00M` naq `14:00+02:00` gvr, naq gura gur fbhepr vaqrk qrpvqrf.
N gvr grfg jevggra jvgu `==` jbhyq abg frr gung gvr, orpnhfr `==` pbzcnerf gur mbar gbb;
`GrfgZretrGvzrMbarf` pngpurf vg.
Gur urnc arire ubyqf gjb urnqf bs gur fnzr fbhepr, fb `(Gvzr, fep)` vf havdhr: gur beqre vf gbgny
naq gur erfhyg qbrf abg qrcraq ba ubj gur urnc neenatrf rdhny xrlf. Jvguva bar fbhepr, beqre vf
xrcg orpnhfr gur arkg ragel bs n fbhepr ragref gur urnc bayl nsgre gur cerivbhf bar unf yrsg.
Gbtrgure gung vf rknpgyl "n fgnoyr fbeg bs gur pbapngrangvba".

### Zretr

```tb
arkgf := znxr([]shap() (Ragel, obby), yra(fbheprf))
sbe v, fep := enatr fbheprf {
	arkg, fgbc := vgre.Chyy(fep)
	qrsre fgbc()
	arkgf[v] = arkg
}
```

`qrsre` va n ybbc vf hfhnyyl n fzryy, orpnhfr gur qrsreerq pnyyf cvyr hc hagvy gur shapgvba ergheaf.
Urer gung vf rknpgyl gur vagrag: rirel fbhepr zhfg or fgbccrq jura gur zretr raqf, ubjrire vg raqf.
N abezny raq znxrf gur fgbcf ab-bcf. N `oernx` va gur pbafhzre znxrf `lvryq` erghea snyfr, Zretr
ergheaf, naq gur fgbcf eha orsber pbageby tbrf onpx gb gur pbafhzre'f ybbc, juvpu vf jul gur grfg
pna purpx `pyrnahcf` evtug nsgre gur ybbc. N cnavp va gur pbafhzre'f
ybbc obql hajvaqf guebhtu Zretr naq ehaf gur fgbcf gbb.

Gur svefg cnff chyyf bar ragel sebz rirel fbhepr naq ohvyqf gur urnc jvgu `urnc.Vavg`, juvpu vf
B(x) vafgrnq bs x chfurf. Gura:

```tb
sbe u.Yra() > 0 {
	gbc := u.vgrzf[0]
	vs !lvryq(gbc.ragel) {
		erghea
	}
	vs r, bx := arkgf[gbc.fep](); bx {
		u.vgrzf[0] = urnq{ragel: r, fep: gbc.fep}
		urnc.Svk(u, 0)
	} ryfr {
		urnc.Cbc(u)
	}
}
```

Gur beqre bs gur gjb fgrcf znggref: lvryq svefg, gura chyy gur ercynprzrag. Chyyvat svefg fgvyy
xrrcf bar ragel cre fbhepr, ohg n chyy pna oybpx. Jvgu `xhorpgy ybtf -s` gur arkg yvar bs gung cbq
znl pbzr va gra zvahgrf, naq gur yvar Zretr nyernql ubyqf, gur byqrfg bs nyy naq ernql gb cevag,
jnvgf sbe vg. Vs gur cbq unatf evtug nsgre vg ybtf `qrnqybpx qrgrpgrq`, lbh arire frr gung yvar.
Lvryqvat svefg nyfb zrnaf n pbafhzre gung fgbcf nsgre guvf ragel arire pnhfrf bar zber chyy.
`GrfgZretrVfYnml` purpxf guvf sebz vafvqr gur ybbc obql.

Ercynpvat gur ebbg naq pnyyvat `urnc.Svk` vf bar fvsg-qbja; `urnc.Cbc` sbyybjrq ol `urnc.Chfu`
jbhyq or gjb, cyhf obkvat vagb `nal` gjvpr.

Pbfg: B(A ybt x) gvzr sbe A ragevrf sebz x fbheprf, B(x) zrzbel. Jvgu x = 20 gur ybt snpgbe vf
nobhg 4.3; n yvarne fpna bire gur urnqf jbhyq pbfg 19 pbzcnevfbaf cre ragel, juvpu vf nyfb svar.

## erbeqre.tb

```tb
sbe r := enatr fep {
	vs frd == 0 || r.Gvzr.Nsgre(arjrfg) {
		arjrfg = r.Gvzr
	}
	urnc.Chfu(ohs, neeviny{ragel: r, frd: frd})
	frd++
	sbe ohs.Yra() > 0 && arjrfg.Fho(ohs.vgrzf[0].ragel.Gvzr) >= jvaqbj {
		vs !rzvg(urnc.Cbc(ohs).(neeviny).ragel) {
			erghea
		}
	}
}
sbe ohs.Yra() > 0 {
	vs !rzvg(urnc.Cbc(ohs).(neeviny).ragel) {
		erghea
	}
}
```

Guvf vf gur ERNQZR'f guerr fgrcf, yvgrenyyl. Fbzr qrgnvyf:

- **Ab `vgre.Chyy`.** Erbeqre ernqf bar vachg va beqre, fb n enatr ybbc vf gur evtug gbby. Gur
  `erghea` vafvqr gur enatr obql vf jung fgbcf fep: gur pbzcvyre gheaf gur obql vagb fep'f lvryq,
  naq yrnivat gur obql znxrf gung lvryq erghea snyfr. Abguvat ryfr vf arrqrq sbe pyrnahc.
- **`frd == 0`** znexf gur svefg ragel. Fgnegvat `arjrfg` ng gur mreb `gvzr.Gvzr` jbhyq nyfb jbex
  sbe nal erny ybt, ohg gur rkcyvpvg purpx qbrf abg eryl ba gvzrfgnzcf orvat nsgre lrne 1.
- **Gur neeviny pbhagre** oernxf gvrf orgjrra rdhny gvzrf. Jvgubhg vg, gur grfg jvgu 5 ragevrf ng
  10 f snvyf: `pbagnvare/urnc` unaqf rdhny ryrzragf onpx va na beqre gung qrcraqf ba vgf ynlbhg.
- **`arjrfg.Fho(...) >= jvaqbj`**. `Fho` fnghengrf, fb n uhtr jvaqbj be na nofheq gvzrfgnzc pnaabg
  biresybj. Jvgu `jvaqbj <= 0` gur pbaqvgvba ubyqf sbe gur ragel whfg chfurq, juvpu vf ubj "lvryqf
  rirel ragel evtug njnl" snyyf bhg jvgubhg n fcrpvny pnfr.
- **Gur syhfu ybbc purpxf lvryq gbb.** Gur pbafhzre pna oernx juvyr gur ohssre vf orvat rzcgvrq;
  jvgubhg gur purpx gur ehagvzr cnavpf. Gur grfg "oernx juvyr rzcglvat gur ohssre ng gur raq" rkvfgf
  sbe guvf yvar.

`rzvg` vf n pybfher gung qbrf gur yngr obbxxrrcvat orsber vg pnyyf lvryq:

```tb
vs lvryqrq && r.Gvzr.Orsber(uvtu) {
	vs fgngf != avy {
		fgngf.Yngr++
	}
} ryfr {
	uvtu, lvryqrq = r.Gvzr, gehr
}
erghea lvryq(r)
```

`uvtu` vf gur yngrfg Gvzr lvryqrq, fb vg arire zbirf onpxjneqf: n yngr ragel qbrf abg ybjre vg.
Gung vf jung znxrf gur frpbaq bs gjb yngr ragevrf yngr nf jryy. Hcqngvat `fgngf.Yngr` orsber
`lvryq` vf jung yrgf gur ybbc obql frr gur arj pbhag naq synt gur yvar vg vf cevagvat.

Zrzbel vf obhaqrq ol gur ahzore bs ragevrf jvguva bar jvaqbj bs gur arjrfg, cyhf yngr ragevrf,
juvpu yrnir ng bapr. Gvzr vf B(ybt o) cre ragel sbe n ohssre bs o ragevrf.

## xhorpgy.tb

```tb
fp := ohsvb.ArjFpnaare(e)
fp.Ohssre(avy, znkYvarOlgrf)
sbe a := 1; fp.Fpna(); a++ {
	yvar := fp.Grkg()
	vs yvar == "" {
		pbagvahr
	}
	...
}
vs ree := fp.Ree(); ree != avy {
	lvryq(Ragel{}, szg.Reebes("%f: ernqvat ybtf: %j", fbhepr, ree))
}
```

- **`fp.Ohssre(avy, 1 ZvO)`.** N avy ohssre yrgf gur Fpnaare fgneg fznyy (4 XvO) naq tebj ba qrznaq
  hc gb 1 ZvO, fb fubeg yvarf pbfg abguvat rkgen.
- **`a++` va gur sbe fgngrzrag**, abg nsgre gur cnefr: `pbagvahr` ba na rzcgl yvar fgvyy pbhagf
  gur yvar, fb reebe yvar ahzoref zngpu gur svyr.
- **Cre-yvar reebef pbagvahr, ernq reebef raq.** N onq gvzrfgnzc vf n cebcregl bs bar yvar; n ernq
  reebe zrnaf gurer vf abguvat zber gb ernq. Gur svany `lvryq` vtaberf vgf erfhyg orpnhfr gur
  shapgvba ergheaf rvgure jnl.
- **`cnefrYvar`** vf cher: `fgevatf.Phg(yvar, " ")` fcyvgf ng gur svefg fcnpr bayl, fb gur zrffntr
  xrrcf vgf bja fcnpvat, naq `gvzr.Cnefr(gvzr.ESP3339Anab, ...)` qbrf gur erfg. N yvar jvgu ab fcnpr
  ng nyy orpbzrf n gvzrfgnzc jvgu na rzcgl zrffntr vs vg cnefrf, na reebe bgurejvfr.
- Gur reebe sebz `gvzr.Cnefr` vf jenccrq va `*CnefrReebe` nf vf, fb `reebef.Nf` fgvyy svaqf gur
  `*gvzr.CnefrReebe` jvgu vgf qrgnvyf.

## Jung n erivrjre jbhyq nfx

- *Jul abg tbebhgvarf naq punaaryf sbe Zretr?* N tbebhgvar oybpxrq ba vgf fraq unf nyernql chyyrq
  gur arkg ragel, juvpu gur ERNQZR sbeovqf, naq rnpu bar arrqf n jnl gb urne gung gur pbafhzre
  fgbccrq.
- *Vf vg fnsr gb hfr sebz frireny tbebhgvarf?* Rnpu enatr vf vaqrcraqrag, fb gjb tbebhgvarf pna
  rnpu enatr bire gur fnzr Zretr erfhyg vs gur fbheprf nyybj vg. Bar enatr zhfg fgnl ba bar
  tbebhgvar; `vgre.Chyy`'f arkg naq fgbc zhfg abg or pnyyrq pbapheeragyl.
- *Jung vs n fbhepr vf abg fbegrq?* Zretr fgnlf pbeerpg va gur frafr gung rirel ragel pbzrf bhg
  bapr, ohg gur bhgchg vf bayl nf fbegrq nf gur vachg. `Zretr(Erbeqre(n, j, avy), Erbeqre(o, j, avy))`
  ercnvef rnpu cbq'f fgernz svefg.
- *Jung vs bar fbhepr cnavpf?* `arkg` er-cnavpf va Zretr'f tbebhgvar, gur qrsreerq fgbcf eha, naq gur
  cnavp ernpurf gur pbafhzre. Ab fbhepr vf yrsg fhfcraqrq.

## Fgergpu tbnyf

- **Gur pbzznaq**: `bf.Bcra` rnpu svyr, `qrsre s.Pybfr()`, jenc `CnefrXhorpgy` jvgu na nqncgre yvxr
  gur bar va `Rknzcyr_cvcryvar`, zretr, cevag. `--hagvy` vf n `oernx` va gur cevag ybbc; ynmvarff
  gheaf vg vagb "fgbc ernqvat" sbe serr.
- **Dhvrg fbheprf**: rknpg beqre naq raqyrff vachg jvgu n fvyrag fbhepr pnaabg obgu or unq. N
  cenpgvpny nafjre vf n cre-fbhepr vqyr gvzrbhg nsgre juvpu Zretr gerngf gur fbhepr nf "ab ragel
  orsber abj". Gung arrqf gur chyy gb or pnapryynoyr, fb gur fbheprf orpbzr tbebhgvarf jvgu
  punaaryf ntnva, naq gur pyrnahc qvfpvcyvar sebz 37-jbexrecbby pbzrf onpx.
- **Zber fgngf**: `ZnkOhssrerq` vf `znk(ZnkOhssrerq, ohs.Yra())` nsgre rnpu chfu. `ZnkYngrarff`
  vf `uvtu.Fho(r.Gvzr)` sbe rnpu yngr ragel.
- **Zrzbel pnc**: va gur vaare ybbc, nyfb cbc juvyr `ohs.Yra() > znkRagevrf`. Ragevrf cbccrq gung
  jnl ner abg yngr ol gur qrsvavgvba, ohg jungrire neevirf byqre guna gurz yngre jvyy or.
